            "author": "Amanda R.",
            "author_subtitle": "Verified Customer"
          }
        },
        "item_VPnR9Q": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Better than the photos",
            "description": "<p>\"I was a little nervous about ordering something personalized online, but the preview matched what arrived. Shipping updates were clear and the decanter feels heavier and nicer than the photos showed.\"</p>",
            "customer_photo": "shopify://shop_images/iap_600x600.8240278404_mxubdkrt.webp",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/iap_600x600.8007326902_7qzlptlv.webp",
            "author": "Michael T.",
            "author_subtitle": "Verified Customer"
          }
        },
        "item_XTUtYy": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "My dad loved the details",
            "description": "<p>\"Bought the police design for my dad after his retirement. He noticed the small details right away. It felt personal without being cheesy, which is exactly what I wanted.\"</p>",
            "customer_photo": "shopify://shop_images/iap_800x800.7287736470_s01qyz5i.webp",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot_1788685564.png",
            "author": "Jessica M.",
            "author_subtitle": "Verified Customer"
          }
        },
        "item_79nB3i": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Helpful before production",
            "description": "<p>\"Customer service helped me fix a spelling mistake before production. That alone saved the gift. The finished set arrived packed well and my brother uses the glasses every weekend.\"</p>",
            "customer_photo": "shopify://shop_images/iap_800x800.6569571263_15t6jz6x.webp",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot_1788685673.png",
            "author": "Daniel K.",
            "author_subtitle": "Verified Customer"
          }
        },
        "item_BUkPE7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Looked expensive",
            "description": "<p>\"The family decanter set made our anniversary dinner feel extra special. The names were centered nicely and the wood box made it look much more expensive than it was.\"</p>",
            "customer_photo": "shopify://shop_images/iap_300x300.4461690900_9f30pqo9.webp",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot_1788685834.png",
            "author": "Rachel S.",
            "author_subtitle": "Verified Customer"
          }
        },
        "item_DtBFNc": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Easy long-distance gift",
            "description": "<p>\"Sent this directly to my best friend, so I only saw photos after she opened it. Everything looked clean and classy, and she said it was one of the most thoughtful gifts she received.\"</p>",
            "customer_photo": "shopify://shop_images/iap_800x800.8001115870_faxgqm0j.webp",
